meta {
  name: Get product by barcode
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{barcode}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  Returns the product. On a local cache miss the server falls back to Open Food Facts and caches the result.

  Response augmentation:
  - All products include unverified: boolean.
  - VERIFIED products: unverified: false.
  - PENDING_REVIEW products: unverified: true, plus a submission object with nutritional fields, and submittedByUserId for registered callers.

  Visibility (P5-007):
  - PENDING_REVIEW products are returned to every caller. The anonymous copy omits submittedByUserId — anonymous users cannot submit, and the field links a user UUID to content.
  - REJECTED products return 404 for every caller.
  - Voting stays registered-only: POST/DELETE /products/:barcode/verify answer an anonymous token with 403.

  Errors: 400 (invalid barcode format), 404 (not found / REJECTED).
}
